This Organ Donation Management System is designed to reduce delays and inefficiencies
in the organ donation process.

The system allows donors and recipients to register on a common platform.

Donor registration includes personal details, blood group, organ type, and medical history.

Recipient registration includes urgency level, required organ, blood group, and medical condition.

The system prioritizes recipients based on urgency, compatibility, and waiting time.

Machine learning techniques are used to detect fake donor entries.

Once a valid donor-recipient match is found, the recipient is immediately notified via email.

The system includes dashboards for administrators to monitor registrations and matches.

The AI chatbot assists donors, recipients, and administrators by answering queries related to the system.

